e rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Zongliang Fu" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[-1--><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Yu Shi" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[-1--><!--]--></li><!--]--> <!--[0--><li class="text-xs hover:text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-300 order-first ml-2"><!--[--><span>7 authors</span><!--]--></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--><!--]--> <!--[0--><span class="mx-1">·</span> <span>Aug 2, 2025</span><!--]--></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-1 !pt-0 z-1 lg:sticky lg:top-8"><!--[0--><a href="/login?next=%2Fpapers%2F2508.02739" class="self-start"><!--[0--><!----><div role="checkbox" class="shadow-alternate group flex h-9 cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border pl-3 pr-3.5 border-gray-300 bg-white dark:bg-gray-850 w-full justify-center"><input disabled="" type="checkbox" class="peer hidden"/> <svg class="text-xs text-gray-500 peer-checked:text-gray-500 group-hover:text-orange-500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.19 2.67a.94.94 0 0 1 1.62 0l3.31 5.72a.94.94 0 0 1-.82 1.4H2.7a.94.94 0 0 1-.82-1.4l3.31-5.7v-.02Z"></path></svg><!----> Upvote <div class="font-semibold text-orange-500">60</div><!----></div><!----><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></a><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <dialog class="shadow-alternate z-40 mx-4 my-auto h-fit select-text overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white max-sm:max-w-[calc(100dvw-2rem)] sm:mx-auto lg:mt-26 md:portrait:mt-30 xl:mt-30 2xl:mt-32 w-full 