ay-900 dark:text-gray-400">Submitted by <div class="flex-none  "><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="max-w-none size-2.5 rounded-full  flex-none select-none " src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/no-auth/losyEyB6XLMUkXgKs_GFC.png" crossorigin="anonymous"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----> bupalinyu</div><!--]--></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-center p-6"><h3 class="mb-1.5 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2609.18063" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer text-balance">The Other Half of the Memory Wall: Serving 35B MoEs from SSD with Trained Routing Prediction</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Edge0 enables efficient mixture-of-experts inference on consumer hardware by predicting expert routing ahead of time and using recovery adapters to maintain quality with minimal active memory.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"><!--[0--><a href="/Edge0" class="inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200/70 bg-blue-50 py-0.5 text-blue-700 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-100 dark:border-blue-500/20 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-500/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 px-1.5 text-xs gap-1 "><!--[0--><img src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/64361bcaf81a16e74367d2e2/D5QI700pnaujz5PeWE6MX.jpeg" alt="Edge0" class="size-3 rounded-sm"/><!--]--> <span class="block min-w-0 truncate font-medium">Edge0</span></a><!--]--> <!--[0--><span class="mx-2">·</span> <span>Published on Sep 16, 2026</span><!--]--></div></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b flex w-40 flex-col items-stretch justify-center gap-2 p-4"><div class="w-full"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-1  z-1 lg:sticky lg:top-8"><!--[0--><a href="/login?ne