  Agents</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">OpenDevin is a platform for developing AI agents that interact with the world by writing code, using command lines, and browsing the web, with support for multiple agents and evaluation benchmarks.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"><!--[-1--><!--[0--><ul class="flex items-center text-gray-600  flex-row-reverse    text-xs "><!--[--><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="RTT1" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="/avatars/ae0314c644f882251baf59b9134fd36f.svg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="frankxu" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="/avatars/c3b00cf275b2805861f5b020c9d00639.svg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="yufansong" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="/avatars/d1ff695f9a8ee0aeeff324fb7f07a811.svg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="liboxuanhk" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="/avatars/79658c23555deadcfb097b6ebccbe4a6.svg" loading="lazy"/><!--]--></li><li