dd432b74ce9/-CQZbBP7FsPPyawYrsi4z.jpeg" crossorigin="anonymous"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----> Lingaaaaaaa</div><!--]--></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b p-4"><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2610.13912" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer">RSI-Anything: Unlocking Recursive Self-Improvement with World Models</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">RSI-Anything leverages predictive world models to guide action selection and adaptive learning, enabling recursive self-improvement across coding, interface navigation, laboratory planning, and scientific optimization tasks.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="mb-3 flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><!--[0--><a href="/PhAILabs" class="inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200/70 bg-blue-50 py-0.5 text-blue-700 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-100 dark:border-blue-500/20 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-500/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 px-1.5 text-xs gap-1 "><!--[0--><img src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/64fde4e252e82dd432b74ce9/5-hyYwAMko5JVJz5qWxEj.png" alt="PhAILabs" class="size-3 rounded-sm"/><!--]--> <span class="block min-w-0 truncate font-medium">PhAI Labs</span></a><!--]--> <!--[0--><span class="mx-1">·</span> <span>Oct 9, 2026</span><!--]--></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-1 !pt-0 z-1 lg:sticky lg:top-8"><!--[0--><a href="/login?next=%2Fpapers%2F2610.13912" class="self-start"><!--[0--><!----><div role="checkbox" class="shadow-alternate group flex h-9 cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border pl-3 pr-3.5 border-gray-300 bg-white dark:bg-gray-850 w-full justify-center"><input disabled="" type="checkbox" class="peer hidden"/> <svg class="text-xs text-gray-500 peer-checked: