le><!--]--><!--[0--><article class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border"><div class="hidden h-40 md:flex"><div class="relative flex-shrink-0"><!--[-1--><a href="/papers/2610.17309" class="block h-full w-56 cursor-pointer overflow-hidden bg-white dark:border-gray-800 max-md:border-b md:border-r"><div class="relative flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden "><!--[0--><div class="absolute inset-0 animate-pulse flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800"></div><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn-thumbnails.huggingface.co/social-thumbnails/papers/2610.17309.png" decoding="async" alt="" class="size-full object-cover object-center opacity-80 dark:opacity-70 dark:invert invisible" onload="this.__e=event" onerror="this.__e=event"/></div><!----></a><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="shadow-xs pointer-events-none absolute bottom-2 right-2 flex h-6 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md border bg-white px-2 text-xs leading-none text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400">Submitted by <div class="flex-none  "><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="max-w-none size-2.5 rounded-full  flex-none select-none " src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6575a625b951d40e7a4d8685/leLO3QA-5YAt8CYRtqp1t.jpeg" crossorigin="anonymous"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----> Lie24</div><!--]--></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-center p-6"><h3 class="mb-1.5 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2610.17309" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer text-balance">StartLux-Decision: AutoThink Decision Models with Reinforcement Learning for Calibrated Deliberative Decisions</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">StartLux-Decision introduces efficient and adaptive decision models using single-pass prediction and confidence-guided reasoning, trained via a three-stage pipeline with RLCD² reinforcement learning, and evaluates them on Decision Index and the DecisionPivot benchmark.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"><!--[0--><a href="/startlux-models" class="inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200/70 bg-blue-50 py-0.5 text-blue-700 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-100 dark:border-blue-500/20 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-500/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 px-1.5 text-xs gap-1 "><!--[0--><img src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/64d33626465b6039259b9c72/6xsdrTfPBTVyKxaNDVi16.png" alt="startlux-models" class="size-3 rounded-sm"/><!--]--> <span class="block min-w-0 truncate font-medium">StartLux</span></a><!--]--> <!--[0--><span class="mx-2">·</span> <span>Published on Oct 12, 2026</span><!--]--></div></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b flex w-40 flex-col items-stretch justify-center gap-2 p-4"><div class="w-full"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 pt-1  z-1 lg:sticky lg:top-8"><!--[0--><a href="/login?next=%2Fpapers%2F2610.17309" class="self-start"><!--[0--><!----><div role="checkbox" class="shadow-alternate group flex h-9 cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border pl-3 pr-3.5 border-gray-300 bg-white dark:bg-gray-850 w-full justify-center text-sm border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800"><input disabled="" type="checkbox" class="peer hidden"/> <svg class="text-xs text-gray-500 peer-checked:text-gray-500 group-hover:text-orange-500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.19 2.67a.94.94 0 0 1 1.62 0l3.31 5.72a.94.94 0 0 1-.82 1.4H2.7a.94.94 0 0 1-.82-1.4l3.31-5.7v-.02Z"></path></svg><!----> Upvote <div class="font-semib