-center bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800"></div><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn-thumbnails.huggingface.co/social-thumbnails/papers/2610.17309.png" decoding="async" alt="" class="size-full object-cover object-center opacity-80 dark:opacity-70 dark:invert invisible" onload="this.__e=event" onerror="this.__e=event"/></div><!----></a><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="shadow-xs pointer-events-none absolute bottom-2 right-2 flex h-6 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md border bg-white px-2 text-xs leading-none text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400">Submitted by <div class="flex-none  "><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="max-w-none size-2.5 rounded-full  flex-none select-none " src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6575a625b951d40e7a4d8685/leLO3QA-5YAt8CYRtqp1t.jpeg" crossorigin="anonymous"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----> Lie24</div><!--]--></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b p-4"><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2610.17309" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer">StartLux-Decision: AutoThink Decision Models with Reinforcement Learning for Calibrated Deliberative Decisions</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">StartLux-Decision introduces efficient and adaptive decision models using single-pass prediction and confidence-guided reasoning, trained via a three-stage pipeline with RLCD² reinforcement learning, and evaluates them on Decision Index and the DecisionPivot benchmark.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="mb-3 flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><!--[0--><a href="/startlux-models" class="inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200/70 bg-blue-50 py-0.5 text-blue-700 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-100 dark:border-blue-500/20 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-500/30 da