s-center justify-center overflow-hidden "><!--[0--><div class="absolute inset-0 animate-pulse flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800"></div><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn-thumbnails.huggingface.co/social-thumbnails/papers/2512.14692.png" decoding="async" alt="" class="size-full object-cover object-center opacity-80 dark:opacity-70 dark:invert invisible" onload="this.__e=event" onerror="this.__e=event"/></div><!----></a><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-center p-6"><h3 class="mb-1.5 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2512.14692" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer text-balance">Native and Compact Structured Latents for 3D Generation</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">A new sparse voxel representation called O-Voxel enables high-quality 3D generative modeling with efficient inference and robust topology handling.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"><!--[0--><a href="/microsoft" class="inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200/70 bg-blue-50 py-0.5 text-blue-700 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-100 dark:border-blue-500/20 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-500/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 px-1.5 text-xs gap-1 "><!--[0--><img src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/1583646260758-5e64858c87403103f9f1055d.png" alt="microsoft" class="size-3 rounded-sm"/><!--]--> <span class="block min-w-0 truncate font-medium">Microsoft</span></a><!--]--> <!--[0--><span class="mx-2">·</span> <span>Published on Dec 16, 2025</span><!--]--></div></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b flex w-40 flex-col items-stretch justify-center gap-2 p-4"><div class="w-full"><div class="