to-b flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-center p-6"><h3 class="mb-1.5 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2504.19413" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer text-balance">Mem0: Building Production-Ready AI Agents with Scalable Long-Term Memory</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Mem0, a memory-centric architecture with graph-based memory, enhances long-term conversational coherence in LLMs by efficiently extracting, consolidating, and retrieving information, outperforming existing memory systems in terms of accuracy and computational efficiency.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center text-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"><!--[-1--><!--[0--><ul class="flex items-center text-gray-600  flex-row-reverse    text-xs mr-1.5"><!--[--><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Taranjeet Singh" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[-1--><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Saket Aryan" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[-1--><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="Dev Khant" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[-1--><!--]--></li><li class="    -mr-1.5 h-3 w-3 md:h-4 md:w-4 bg-linear-to-br block flex-none rounded-full border-2 border-white from-gray-300 to-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900 dark:from-gray-600 dark:to-gray-800 " title="deshrajdry" style="content-visibility:auto;"><!--[1--><img class="overflow-hidden" alt="" src="https://cd