--[0--><a href="/papers/2610.17953" class="block h-48 w-full cursor-pointer overflow-hidden bg-white dark:border-gray-800 max-md:border-b md:border-r"><video src="https://cdn-uploads.huggingface.co/production/uploads/61cd4b833dd34ba1985e0753/GkoYLEiAhqiB099zmOWAw.mp4" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" preload="metadata" class="pointer-events-none size-full object-cover object-center"></video></a><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class="shadow-xs pointer-events-none absolute bottom-2 right-2 flex h-6 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md border bg-white px-2 text-xs leading-none text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400">Submitted by <div class="flex-none  "><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="max-w-none size-2.5 rounded-full  flex-none select-none " src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/61cd4b833dd34ba1985e0753/BfHfrwotoMESpXZOHiIe4.png" crossorigin="anonymous"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----> dongguanting</div><!--]--></div> <div class="from-gray-50-to-white bg-linear-to-b p-4"><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline dark:text-white"><a href="/papers/2610.17953" class="line-clamp-2 cursor-pointer">Agent-Reflex: Teaching Language Agents to Act Reflectively</a></h3> <!--[0--><div class="mb-2"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Agent-Reflex trains interactive agents to reflect and recover from noisy tool feedback and user corrections through skill discovery, supervised fine-tuning, and on-policy optimization.</p></div><!--]--> <div class="mb-3 flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><!--[0--><a href="/RUC-NLPIR" class="inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center rounded-full border border-blue-200/70 bg-blue-50 py-0.5 text-blue-700 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-100 dark:border-blue-500/20 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-500/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 px-1.5 text-xs gap-1 "><!--[0--><img src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/